<title>JAPAN: Dai-ichi Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Dai-ichi Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 19.41		vs	   19.76</p>
<p> Operating	  305    million    vs	  475    million</p>
<p> Current	    203    million    vs	  400    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 82    million    vs	 prft 58 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 2.36 yen	  vs     prft 1.68 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     35 million	  vs	  35 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Dai-ichi Kogyo Seiyaku Co Ltd is the full company name.</p>
